  -i inventory/dev/hosts.ini \
  -b \
  -m shell \
  -a 'systemctl is-active firewalld || true; firewall-cmd --state 2>/dev/null || true; firewall-cmd --get-active-zones 2>/dev/null || true; firewall-cmd --list-all 2>/dev/null || true'
```

For a controlled diagnostic, temporarily stop firewalld on the three cluster nodes:

```bash
ansible masters \
  -i inventory/dev/hosts.ini \
  -b \
  -m systemd \
  -a 'name=firewalld state=stopped'
```

Then immediately retest:

```bash
